**/[Ll]ibrary/
**/[Tt]emp/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Bb]uild/
**/[Bb]uilds/
**/[Ll]ogs/
**/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
**/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
**/[Rr]ecordings/

# Asset Store 工具缓存
**/[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*

# Addressables 默认构建输出
**/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
**/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*

# Gradle 缓存（Android / Quest 打包）
.gradle/

